00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:17,990
Prince!

521
00:29:18,073 --> 00:29:18,903
Go rescue us!

522
00:29:18,986 --> 00:29:21,018
I'm terribly allergic to alligators!

523
00:29:22,100 --> 00:29:24,117
That's my loud-mouthed crew, all right.

524
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:25,977
Thanks for letting me
know they're with you.

525
00:29:26,060 --> 00:29:28,297
All I have to do is find you and I...

526
00:29:28,380 --> 00:29:30,380
Say no!

527
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:34,040
Not so tough now, are you?

528
00:29:34,380 --> 00:29:35,377
We've got him, sir.

529
00:29:35,460 --> 00:29:36,290
Don't worry.

530
00:29:36,500 --> 00:29:40,088
He won't be going anywhere in
the condition we've put him in.

531
00:29:42,100 --> 00:29:42,930
Sanji...

532
00:29:43,013 --> 00:29:43,843
Oh no...

533
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,660
So where are you? Speak up?

534
00:29:46,860 --> 00:29:50,157
I'm at the front of the casino with
the Katorea on top and rain base.

535
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,070
Rain dinners!

536
00:29:51,740 --> 00:29:54,137
If he's not dead, he's gonna wish he was!

537
00:29:54,220 --> 00:29:56,557
Cause I'm gonna kill
him next time I see him!

538
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:57,780
No, Sanji!

539
00:29:59,700 --> 00:30:00,800
That poor guy!

540
00:30:05,060 --> 00:30:06,300
Stay right there.

541
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:11,412
Well, we shouldn't leave the man waiting.

542
00:30:11,700 --> 00:30:12,620
Is this wise?

543
00:30:12,980 --> 00:30:16,177
The millions still don't know the
actual identity of their boss.

544
00:30:16,260 --> 00:30:20,157
Aside from the number agents, no
one knows who you and I truly are.

545
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:23,711
Everyone thinks I'm a local
hero who also owns this casino.

546
00:30:24,080 --> 00:30:26,797
There's nothing suspicious
about a proprietor going

547
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,877
to see what happened in
front of this building.

548
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,520
Our secret will be safe.

549
00:30:36,420 --> 00:30:37,250
Baby!

550
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:42,012
Hey, what are you doing?

551
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:45,737
We still have time before this
room fills completely with water.

552
00:30:45,820 --> 00:30:47,757
I'm going outside to help you know who.

553
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:48,670
Gotcha.

554
00:30:48,753 --> 00:30:50,477
There's no way he kicked
the bucket, not that guy.

555
00:30:50,560 --> 00:30:53,257
If you can get him free, then
I'm sure he can get us free.

556
00:30:53,340 --> 00:30:54,577
And Chopper's out there too,

557
00:30:54,660 --> 00:30:58,072
so we might actually have a
chance of getting out of here.

558
00:30:58,340 --> 00:30:59,620
Baby, look out!

559
00:31:06,920 --> 00:31:08,880
I've had enough of your nonsense.

560
00:31:23,100 --> 00:31:25,860
Since you care for your friends that much,

561
00:31:25,980 --> 00:31:28,317
Miss Wednesday, you can
just die here with them.

562
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:32,220
Which, thanks to the rising
water and my hungry pets outside,

563
00:31:32,540 --> 00:31:34,420
should occur very, very soon.

564
00:31:34,940 --> 00:31:37,597
Now, if you'll excuse
me, I'm going to drag Mr.

565
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:39,077
Prince back here to join you.

566
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,925
I hope you don't mind corpses.

567
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:47,030
Crocodile!

568
00:31:56,500 --> 00:31:59,060
Oh, my. Mr. Crocodile, sir.

569
00:31:59,320 --> 00:32:01,908
Have you heard what's
happening in Nanohana?

570
00:32:02,080 --> 00:32:04,160
Hmm. Yes. Tragic. The whole town.

571
00:32:04,340 --> 00:32:06,317
No, the whole country is in an uproar.

572
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,637
Everyone's talking about it.

573
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:12,117
It appears the royal army and the rebel
army, they're finally about to clash.

574
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:13,030
Oh, well.

575
00:32:13,140 --> 00:32:16,597
I'm not surprised the king does
let pirates attack the cities.

576
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:18,577
I always thought something like this might

577
00:32:18,660 --> 00:32:20,997
happen if Cobra kept
letting this country suffer.

578
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:22,257
Hey, look over there!

579
00:32:22,340 --> 00:32:23,170
It's him!

580
00:32:23,340 --> 00:32:25,540
Crocodile! I love him! Wow!

581
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:27,760
A public appearance in the casino!

582
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:35,322
Seems you're as popular as ever.

583
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:38,550
Daisy!

584
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:44,657
They've been there for me all this time.

585
00:32:44,740 --> 00:32:48,920
You've never let me down,
so I do not let them down.

586
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:51,440
And I won't let them die like this.

587
00:33:00,340 --> 00:33:02,200
All right, she got away.

588
00:33:09,700 --> 00:33:11,757
Things have just gone from bad to worse.

589
00:33:11,840 --> 00:33:13,360
And the rain is blowing!

590
00:33:13,520 --> 00:33:14,797
We don't even have an hour left!

591
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:17,056
We'll be lucky if we have 20 minutes!

592
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:19,900
Vivi! Are you okay?

593
00:33:21,940 --> 00:33:22,770
I'm fine!

594
00:33:23,120 --> 00:33:25,397
I'm going to get help, so just hold on!

595
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:26,997
I will get you out of there!

596
00:33:27,080 --> 00:33:29,137
I'm not going to abandon
any of you, I promise!

597
00:33:29,220 --> 00:33:31,017
I'll be right back with help, okay?

598
00:33:31,100 --> 00:33:31,930
Okay!

599
00:33:32,013 --> 00:33:33,440
You can do it, Vivi!

600
00:33:36,420 --> 00:33:39,520
What the hell is this?

601
00:33:40,220 --> 00:33:43,077
These were the remaining
millions we had in town.

602
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:46,077
If you include those that
Pell the Falcon took down,

603
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:48,689
every last one of them
have been wiped out.

604
00:33:48,820 --> 00:33:50,700
Hey, who did this? Tell me.

605
00:33:52,300 --> 00:33:53,500
A guy.

606
00:33:53,820 --> 00:33:55,940
He was called Mr. Prince.

607
00:33:56,340 --> 00:33:58,458
But I thought you idiots caught him.

608
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:00,287
So where the hell did he go?

609
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:03,460
He headed toward the south part of town.

610
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:04,640
He just left.

611
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:06,630
South?

612
00:34:06,713 --> 00:34:07,543
I see.

613
00:34:10,780 --> 00:34:11,610
Run, then.

614
00:34:11,693 --> 00:34:14,260
Run all you want, but you can't escape me.

615
00:34:15,820 --> 00:34:17,220
You could forget him.

616
00:34:18,200 --> 00:34:19,030
Oh, no.

617
00:34:19,113 --> 00:34:21,779
I've always killed those
foolish enough to cross me.

618
00:34:22,260 --> 00:34:25,180
And that's not a habit
I'm quitting anytime soon!

619
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:34,140
Oh, is that a crazy wipe?

620
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:35,260
I'm not sure.

621
00:34:35,560 --> 00:34:37,917
But it caused the bridge
to the casino to collapse.

622
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:39,700
The whole thing's gone.

623
00:34:40,380 --> 00:34:41,210
What?

624
00:34:41,293 --> 00:34:42,377
You mean we're stranded in here?

625
00:34:42,460 --> 00:34:43,900
Now I can't gamble.

626
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:49,177
Hey, how do we get out of here?

627
00:34:49,260 --> 00:34:50,090
Aren't there any boats?

628
00:34:50,173 --> 00:34:51,003
What happened?

629
00:34:51,260 --> 00:34:52,540
The bridge collapsed!

630
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,220
What? Oh, no.

631
00:34:57,360 --> 00:34:58,500
The bridge is out.

632
00:34:58,600 --> 00:35:00,071
That means I'm locked in.

633
00:35:00,260 --> 00:35:02,060
I didn't do it to keep you in.

634
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:05,692
I did it to keep those Baroque
works creeps out, gorgeous.

635
00:35:08,140 --> 00:35:10,140
It's one part of the plan you see.

636
00:35:12,680 --> 00:35:16,197
The other part is chopper running
around town is a decoy we're

637
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:18,857
going to stop the civil war that's
about to erupt in this country!

638
00:35:18,940 --> 00:35:20,280
We've got to hurry so?

639
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:28,900
Think you can tell me where our
friends are at well princess?
